node_modules/
# The operator's credential. The read has moved to `<repoRoot>/.speepobox/.env`
# (T58), where `.speepobox/.gitignore` already ignores it; this entry stays until
# the operator's own `mv .env .speepobox/.env` on the host, so no `git add -A` in
# the gap can commit a token (19 §3). Everything else speepobox keeps out of the
# tree is `.speepobox/.gitignore`'s now (T57).
.env
